# Davison Financial Model — Developer README

This README is the quick-start document for returning to the project after a long break.

For the complete context, also read:

```text
PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md
PROJECT_STATE.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
DATA_MODEL.md
```

---

# Start the Application

From the project root:

```text
python -m src.gui.app
```

On Windows, the project also includes:

```text
run_financical_model.bat
```

The batch file activates `.venv` and starts the application.

---

# Run Tests

```text
python -m pytest
```

Pytest is configured in:

```text
pyproject.toml
```

---

# Python Version

The project requires:

```text
Python 3.13+
```

---

# Dependencies

Declared in `pyproject.toml`:

```text
sqlalchemy>=2.0
openpyxl>=3.1
yfinance>=1.4
```

